{"title":"2018 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part B","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all pairs of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db0981fbe1d3f53f2bf07fe3a31a1aa452b6b5f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab - b + a - 1 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/6/896ec5f6719203c7b18c779a5b6e6027e6371e37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(a - 1) + 1(a - 1) = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/4/4441f978a93fb5b6633fd871f85abfd861bb497b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b + 1)(a - 1) = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/b/30b55c82f0197af656652ef328ae9e61159231d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> must always be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> since both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive integers. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/b/30b55c82f0197af656652ef328ae9e61159231d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/101fba57f204a8ae424321cc533ce7e7e78f87d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> must multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the possible pairs for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/5/3550ad5dc17ad4dc32bffbdff83d8b536615b480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + 1, b + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/0/5506b58320deb5004bf2ed2f1a5e3e672d6e326e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a1acbf245a710398f64953985490d7b1134630b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd17a81d55cd9e690235a55ac120f2d278908c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/9/3b9f1f611d1321222fb23a6107e6f37c9f4bc1e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - 1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b3ad96c76656d8fbdb4bce5406b91ae54935010.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 1 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/2/7128d5b9833cebccc25e67d40c4ffbd53b62ceaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - 1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/246ec286b9641f91f9dfa14932e47171e2fad854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf0953f43c76a5c79f339f9aee0fc2baac51413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the possible pairs for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd8bd034ef2c5bfef2641867afd2cc8ec923853.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(3, 1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"54\" height=\"32\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/245e5432b4dd513350f336084a4ea339f5b01291.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(2, 3)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"54\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 89/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4427/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.897      1 2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\n100.00%    5.897      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37291:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018062058 and revision id 287938. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}